---
import '../styles.css'

import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import { siteConfig } from '../lib/site-config'

const { site } = siteConfig
const title = 'About Ayoub Abedrabbo | Digital Media Specialist'
const description =
  'Meet Ayoub Abedrabbo, a Tampa media producer, husband, and father sharing beneficial knowledge through tutorials and reflections inspired by his faith.'
const canonicalUrl = new URL('/about/', Astro.site).toString()
const ogImage = new URL('/og-ayoub-digital-media.jpg', Astro.site).toString()
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalUrl={canonicalUrl}
  ogImage={ogImage}
  ogImageWidth={1200}
  ogImageHeight={630}
  ogImageType="image/jpeg"
  ogImageAlt={site.ogImageAlt}
  activeNav="about"
>
  <main
    id="main-content"
    class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl scroll-mt-20 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14 lg:px-8 lg:py-20"
  >
    <header data-reveal="up">
      <p class="text-primary text-sm font-bold tracking-wide uppercase">
        About
      </p>
      <h1
        class="font-heading mt-3 text-4xl leading-none font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl"
      >
        Ayoub Abedrabbo
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-5 text-lg leading-8">
        I'm Ayoub, a husband, father, and digital media producer based in Tampa.
        I run AlphaBravoMedia, where I work on video, photography, and podcasts
        for businesses, schools, and community organizations. I also share what
        I learn through tutorials and personal reflections.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-base leading-8" data-reveal="up">
      <p>
        I started making videos after high school because I wanted my own
        channel. At first, I thought it would be fun, and part of me wanted to
        get popular. But as I kept going, I started thinking about what else I
        could do with it. I wanted to make something more beneficial, something
        educational, and something that could benefit people Islamically.
      </p>
      <p>
        As a Muslim, I believe sharing beneficial knowledge is an ongoing
        charity. That's a big part of why I teach. It's something I'm good at,
        and when I learn something useful, I want to pass it on. I read the
        Quran, Hadith, Islamic books, business books, and books on other
        subjects. Social media is a powerful way to get a message out there, and
        I try to use it for that purpose.
      </p>
      <p>
        Over time, people I was making things for started asking, "Do you
        charge?" I had been doing it for free, but those conversations
        eventually became paid work. Today, media production is my livelihood,
        and I continue to teach for free on YouTube, including tutorials on
        DaVinci Resolve.
      </p>
      <p>
        On <a
          class="underline underline-offset-4"
          href="https://islam.ayoubabed.xyz"
        >
          islam.ayoubabed.xyz
        </a>, I write personal reflections and lessons I take from reading the
        Quran and Hadith. When I don't have time to make a video, I write it
        down and post it as an article.
      </p>
      <p>
        Getting married changed my outlook on life and the responsibility I have
        as a man. I feel it has made me more responsible, helped me grow
        spiritually, and made me a better man. My family is an important part of
        my life.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm also interested in AI. It's new, we're learning how to use it, and
        it's changing how we do things. I feel blessed to live in the United
        States, where so much of that work is happening, and I think it can
        benefit people all over the world. So much of daily life touches a
        computer, whether through a phone, an application, a website, or
        communication. We need to learn how to use and understand AI, and I care
        about it going in the right direction. I use it to help build this
        website and tools for my media work.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can browse my <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/">
          portfolio
        </a>, look through the <a
          class="underline underline-offset-4"
          href="/galleries/"
        >
          event galleries
        </a>, or <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/contact/">
          get in touch
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
